@startuml Kafka元数据运行时工作流程

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam participantBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam participantBorderColor #6C757D
skinparam arrowColor #495057
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3CD
skinparam noteBorderColor #FFEAA7

title Kafka元数据运行时工作流程 - 基于源码分析
autonumber

' 参与者定义
participant "客户端请求" as Client
participant "QuorumController" as QC
participant "KafkaRaftClient" as Raft
participant "MetadataLoader" as ML
participant "MetadataBatchLoader" as MBL
participant "MetadataDelta" as MD
participant "MetadataImage" as MI
participant "MetadataPublisher[]" as Publishers
participant "KRaftMetadataCache" as Cache
participant "FeaturesPublisher" as FP
participant "BrokerMetadataPublisher" as BMP

== 1. 元数据记录生成和提交阶段 ==

Client ->> QC: 发送管理请求 (CreateTopic, AlterConfig等)
activate QC

note over QC
    QuorumController.handleRequest()
    生成相应的元数据记录
end note

QC ->> QC: 生成ApiMessageAndVersion记录
note right: 如TopicRecord, ConfigRecord等

QC ->> QC: 预先重放到内存状态
note right
    replay(message, Optional.empty(), recordOffset)
    确保记录可以正确应用
end note

QC ->> Raft: raftClient.prepareAppend(epoch, records)
activate Raft
note right: 准备将记录追加到Raft日志

Raft ->> Raft: 写入本地日志
Raft ->> Raft: 复制到其他节点
Raft -->> QC: 返回预期偏移量
deactivate Raft

QC -->> Client: 返回响应 (可能是异步的)
deactivate QC

== 2. Raft提交通知阶段 ==

Raft ->> QC: handleCommit(BatchReader)
activate QC
activate Raft

note over QC
    QuorumMetaLogListener.handleCommit()
    处理已提交的记录批次
end note

loop 处理每个批次
    QC ->> QC: 读取Batch<ApiMessageAndVersion>
    
    alt 如果是活跃控制器
        QC ->> QC: 更新offsetControl
        QC ->> QC: 完成延迟操作
        note right: deferredEventQueue.completeUpTo()
    else 如果是备用控制器
        QC ->> QC: 重放记录到内存状态
        note right: 保持与活跃控制器同步
    end
end

QC ->> ML: 转发给MetadataLoader
deactivate QC

== 3. 元数据加载和处理阶段 ==

ML ->> ML: eventQueue.append(handleCommit)
activate ML

note over ML
    MetadataLoader.handleCommit()
    在专用线程中处理
end note

loop 处理BatchReader中的每个批次
    ML ->> MBL: batchLoader.loadBatch(batch, leaderAndEpoch)
    activate MBL
    
    note over MBL
        MetadataBatchLoader.loadBatch()
        处理事务状态和记录重放
    end note
    
    loop 处理批次中的每条记录
        MBL ->> MD: delta.replay(record.message())
        activate MD
        
        note over MD
            根据记录类型调用相应的replay方法:
            - TopicRecord -> topicsDelta.replay()
            - ConfigRecord -> configsDelta.replay()
            - RegisterBrokerRecord -> clusterDelta.replay()
            等等
        end note
        
        MD ->> MD: 更新相应的Delta组件
        deactivate MD
    end
    
    alt 如果事务结束或无事务
        MBL ->> MBL: applyDeltaAndUpdate(delta, manifest)
        MBL ->> MI: image = delta.apply(provenance)
        activate MI
        
        note over MI
            MetadataDelta.apply()
            生成新的MetadataImage
        end note
        
        MI ->> MI: 创建新的Image组件
        note right
            - FeaturesImage
            - ClusterImage  
            - TopicsImage
            - ConfigurationsImage
            等等
        end note
        
        MI -->> MBL: 返回新的MetadataImage
        deactivate MI
        
        MBL ->> ML: callback.update(delta, image, manifest)
    end
    
    deactivate MBL
end

ML ->> ML: batchLoader.maybeFlushBatches()

== 4. 元数据发布阶段 ==

ML ->> ML: maybePublishMetadata(delta, image, manifest)

note over ML
    MetadataLoader.maybePublishMetadata()
    通知所有已注册的发布器
end note

loop 通知每个MetadataPublisher
    ML ->> Publishers: publisher.onMetadataUpdate(delta, newImage, manifest)
    activate Publishers

    par 并行通知各个发布器
        Publishers ->> Cache: KRaftMetadataCachePublisher
        activate Cache
        Cache ->> Cache: metadataCache.setImage(newImage)
        note right: 更新Broker的元数据缓存
        deactivate Cache

        Publishers ->> FP: FeaturesPublisher
        activate FP
        FP ->> FP: 更新finalizedFeatures
        note right: 更新特性版本信息
        deactivate FP

        Publishers ->> BMP: BrokerMetadataPublisher
        activate BMP
        BMP ->> BMP: 处理各种元数据变更
        note right
            - 更新分区状态
            - 处理配置变更
            - 管理配额设置
            等等
        end note
        deactivate BMP
    end

    deactivate Publishers
end

ML ->> ML: 更新metrics和状态
deactivate ML

deactivate Raft

== 5. 快照处理流程 (可选) ==

alt 当需要加载快照时
    Raft ->> ML: handleLoadSnapshot(SnapshotReader)
    activate ML
    activate Raft
    
    note over ML
        MetadataLoader.handleLoadSnapshot()
        从快照恢复元数据状态
    end note
    
    ML ->> ML: 创建空的MetadataDelta
    ML ->> ML: loadSnapshot(delta, reader)
    
    loop 读取快照中的每个批次
        ML ->> MD: delta.replay(record)
        activate MD
        MD ->> MD: 重放快照记录
        deactivate MD
    end
    
    ML ->> MD: delta.finishSnapshot()
    activate MD
    note over MD: 完成快照加载，清理未引用的数据
    deactivate MD
    
    ML ->> MI: image = delta.apply(provenance)
    activate MI
    MI -->> ML: 返回新的MetadataImage
    deactivate MI
    
    ML ->> Publishers: 通知所有发布器
    activate Publishers
    Publishers ->> Publishers: 处理快照数据
    deactivate Publishers
    
    deactivate ML
    deactivate Raft
end

== 6. 领导者变更处理 ==

alt 当控制器领导者发生变更时
    Raft ->> ML: handleLeaderChange(LeaderAndEpoch)
    activate ML
    activate Raft
    
    note over ML
        MetadataLoader.handleLeaderChange()
        通知发布器领导者变更
    end note
    
    ML ->> ML: 更新currentLeaderAndEpoch
    
    loop 通知每个发布器
        ML ->> Publishers: publisher.onControllerChange(leaderAndEpoch)
        activate Publishers
        Publishers ->> Publishers: 处理领导者变更
        note right: 可能需要重新连接或重置状态
        deactivate Publishers
    end
    
    deactivate ML
    deactivate Raft
end

note over Client, BMP
    <b>关键设计特点:</b>
    1. <b>异步处理:</b> 使用事件队列确保元数据处理不阻塞Raft线程
    2. <b>事务支持:</b> 支持元数据记录的事务性批量提交
    3. <b>增量更新:</b> 通过Delta机制实现高效的增量更新
    4. <b>发布器模式:</b> 解耦元数据生产者和消费者
    5. <b>故障处理:</b> 完善的错误处理和恢复机制
    6. <b>快照优化:</b> 支持快照加载以减少启动时间
end note

@enduml
